\pard\b\fs20 Tropical Seas\b0\par
\fs16\par
Great! You finally managed to get off the tropical island in a sailing boat, and you land right on another island.\par
Unfortunately you will find that the island itself is completely useless, with nothing but stones in the ground. A dive into the sea would be worthwhile, though: the seabed holds a wealth of valuable shells, and the ground there is brimming with minerals.\par
So you decide to build a splendid village on this island, with 1000 settlement points, 1 submarine and a castle.\par
